<title>USA: TENNIS-LOS ANGELES OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LOS ANGELES OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $303,000</p>
<p>Infiniti Open men's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Byron Black (Zimbabwe) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3) 6-2</p>
<p>2-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) 6-3</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Guillaume Raoux (France) beat 3-Mark Philippoussis 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>6-Jim Courier (U.S.) beat 4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5) 7-5</p>
</text>
